.SH NAME
mesh-identity \- OS-level Isolation of Sharded Keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B germany/
- u0_a203 (Root/S25FE OS)
.B aellok/
- Isolated Environment (ISP/Google Service Account)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Germany and Aellok MUST NOT share directory space. 
Map keys to separate OS contexts to prevent cross-pollination.
